<section class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/contractor.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/contractor-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/contractor.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Services</nav><p class="kicker lt">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Claim Dispute Services in South Carolina</h1><p class="lede">Insurance claim dispute services built on one thing: an accurate, defensible valuation of the loss. Pick a single estimate review, full appraisal representation or neutral umpire work.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn cu" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ol" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards"><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">01</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Appraisal Demand Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name after a South Carolina appraisal demand is made by you or your insurer.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburb-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburb-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburb-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">02</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Home Insurance Appraisal</h2><p>Independent appraisal for homeowners whose insurer accepted the claim but paid far less than repairs cost.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">03</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for HOAs, condo associations, churches, retail centers and apartment owners with disputed property claims.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">04</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for roof claims where slopes, matching, code items or hail bruising are in dispute.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/wind-tornado-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">05</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Wind &amp; Tornado Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for straight-line wind and tornado claims, from torn shingles to structural damage.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/hurricane-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">06</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Hurricane Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for hurricane and tropical storm claims, including SCWHUA wind policies and split wind/flood losses.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/eave-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/eave-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/eave-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">07</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Water Damage Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for burst pipes, appliance leaks, roof leaks and other sudden water losses that were underpaid.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">08</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for fire, smoke, soot and lightning losses where cleaning, rebuild or contents values are disputed.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/tree-fall-ice-storm-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tree-crew.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tree-crew-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tree-crew.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">09</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Tree Fall &amp; Ice Storm Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for homes damaged by falling trees and limbs after hurricanes, thunderstorms or ice storms.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/earthquake-claim-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/charleston-masonry.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/charleston-masonry-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/charleston-masonry.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">10</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Earthquake Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for endorsed earthquake losses, starting with a check that earthquake coverage exists at all.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/claim-estimate-review/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-review.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">11</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Claim Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the insurer’s estimate so you know what is missing before you sign or demand appraisal.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-dispute-services/umpire-neutral-appraiser/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="num">12</span></span><span class="cb"><h2>Umpire &amp; Neutral Appraiser</h2><p>Neutral umpire service for appraisal panels where we represent neither the policyholder nor the insurer.</p><span class="go">Learn more</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap two top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and some disputes close right there with a documented supplement.</p><a class="btn" href="/claim-dispute-services/claim-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one stage?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you take commercial and HOA claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes — condo associations, apartment communities, churches, retail and office buildings, as well as single-family homes.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only handle hurricane claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. We also value hail, tornado, tree fall, water, fire and endorsed earthquake losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-photo"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.15"><div class="wrap rv"><p class="kicker lt" style="justify-content:center">Free first review</p><h2>Have a claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send the carrier’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you plainly what we see.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn cu" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ol" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
